{"id":"731b3921ecc18a96","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-topo9-tightness.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Tightness","display":"df-zfc-topo9-tightness — ZFC Topo9 Tightness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-tightness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-tightness"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-tightness — ZFC Topo9 Tightness","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-tightness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-tightness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-tightness — ZFC Topo9 Tightness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> is the topology predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> is the closure predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>, cardinality, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (local helper predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Tightness}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Tightness}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}tightness\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists B,D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nB\\subseteq A\n\\land|B|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,B,D)\n\\land x\\in D\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}tightness\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\forall C\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,A,C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{29mm}\\to\\forall x\\in C\\;\\exists B,D\\in V\\;\\bigl(\nB\\subseteq A\n\\land|B|\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,B,D)\n\\land x\\in D\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}tightness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Tightness}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}tightness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9Tightness}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9TightnessBound}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\n\\to\\kappa\\leq\\lambda\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The helper predicate states the closure-witness bound without an unsourced closure operator; the second assertion selects the least infinite cardinal satisfying it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"reso